| Module | Raw uL | % concentrate | Function owned |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| Tailored aperture | 350 | 5.833 | Polished directional entry; cardamom remains first recognizer |
| Cold cardamom shell | 600 | 10.000 | Pod surface, volatile width, and cardamom-to-lavender continuity |
| Lavender prism | 750 | 12.500 | Floral tenderness, aromatic stem, cool pressure, and radiance |
| Warm seed/coumarin interior | 550 | 9.167 | Dry crushed-seed body and non-pastry warmth |
| Tailored iris/suede seam | 300 | 5.000 | Couture surface detail and a warm-heart-to-wood interface |
| Vertical cedar/vetiver woods | 1100 | 18.333 | Dry verticality, root shadow, textile depth, and subject continuity |
| Sculpted sandalwood volume | 850 | 14.167 | Separated soft, round, dark, mineral, and warm depth planes |
| Pressure and dark contour | 400 | 6.667 | Restrained silhouette and tension around the tender core |
| Quiet matrix | 400 | 6.667 | Bloom, smoothing, and volatile-to-substantive continuity |
| Exact skin echo | 350 | 5.833 | One coumarin-compatible creamy skin musk |
| Dedicated stitches | 350 | 5.833 | Five narrow interfaces between the principal planes |
| **Total** | **6000** | **100.000** | |

Each retained material must own a spatial plane, texture, interface, recurrence, pressure/release mechanism, or necessary diffusion/fixation field. Ingredient count is not evidence of complexity. A modeled inaudible character row, an aliased duplicate, or a redundant texture is removed or rebased after the first governed run.

## Spatial and temporal transition map

```text
bergamot rind + petitgrain grain + aldehydic glint
    -> cold cardamom capsule + beta-pinene edge
    -> linalyl/linalool bridge + lavender floral/stem prism
    -> dihydrojasmone + coumarin/tonka crushed-seed interior
    -> ionone/irotyl cloth + restrained suede pressure
    -> cedar/vetiver verticals through differentiated sandalwood depth
    -> mineral amber contour around one Ethylene Brassylate skin echo

0–3 min:   cardamom before citrus; cold tailored capsule
3–30 min:  shell opens into lavender rather than leaving it behind
30–120 min: warm seed appears behind an still-audible aromatic subject
2–6 h:     cedar/vetiver and sandalwood deepen the same subject
6 h+:      coumarinic, linalyl, ionone, and skin relationships recall it
```

All temporal statements above are design intent, not observed behavior.

